          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-18T01:07:17.149Z",
          "html": "<p>Renamed:  \"over the ceiling\" is \"limit\", which also covers asking too often.  It is in decision Q86, and in round 2's Q20 table.</p>"
        }
